WEBVTT

00:06.310 --> 00:08.750
Are you watching those 
animal challenge videos?

00:08.750 --> 00:11.490
Huh? They challenge animals or something?

00:12.330 --> 00:13.450
Man...

00:16.320 --> 00:18.370
Good on you for keeping up 
with club meets, though.

00:18.370 --> 00:19.730
Morning!

00:26.040 --> 00:27.680
Hey. Look what I bought!

00:27.680 --> 00:29.050
The limited-edition one.

00:29.460 --> 00:31.840
I'll be there in five minutes.

00:31.840 --> 00:33.550
Morning!

00:35.470 --> 00:38.830
<i>I have a crush on a girl.</i>

00:41.220 --> 00:44.560
<i>I have a crush on a girl.</i>

00:47.290 --> 00:51.190
<i>That girl...</i>

00:54.750 --> 00:56.780
<i>That girl...</i>

01:00.640 --> 01:02.370
<i>Is always on my mind.</i>

01:07.010 --> 01:11.630
<i>I'm always thinking about her.</i>

01:18.730 --> 01:19.680
<i>Mie-san.</i>

01:55.750 --> 01:58.110
<i>I'm...</i>

02:02.410 --> 02:04.720
<i>I'm...</i>

02:08.270 --> 02:09.730
Morning!

02:14.730 --> 02:16.390
<i>I'm...</i>

02:16.390 --> 02:17.670
Oh, sorry!

02:16.390 --> 02:17.670
It's okay.

02:20.160 --> 02:20.960
Morning!

02:21.040 --> 02:22.000
Morning!

02:31.330 --> 02:33.380
Oops, I forgot something!

02:35.900 --> 02:36.340
Morning.

02:36.380 --> 02:36.670
Morning.

02:36.710 --> 02:37.590
Morning.

02:38.400 --> 02:40.510
Gotta work hard at the club meet today.

02:40.510 --> 02:41.340
Yeah, we should.

02:41.340 --> 02:42.860
The boss is crazy.

02:42.860 --> 02:43.720
I know.

02:43.720 --> 02:45.310
I barely won.

02:45.310 --> 02:46.160
Right?

02:50.040 --> 02:52.220
It's just so witty.

02:52.220 --> 02:54.650
It's the timing.

02:56.200 --> 02:59.390
Isn't my cute cat? So cute!

03:01.640 --> 03:05.620
<i>I'm in love with her.</i>

03:08.560 --> 03:10.370
In 1333,

03:10.370 --> 03:16.970
Nitta Yoshitada led his army of over 200,000 in 
an attack on the shogunate's base in Kamakura.

03:17.490 --> 03:20.300
Hojo Takatoki, the de facto head 
of the shogunate at the time,

03:20.300 --> 03:20.300
took his family to their family temple of Toshoji, 
committing suicide by setting fire to the building.

03:20.300 --> 03:20.680
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

03:20.680 --> 03:23.310
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

03:26.310 --> 03:31.720
It's said that this was what ended the 
Kamakura shogunate's 150 years of rule.

03:32.210 --> 03:32.940
Later that year...

03:32.940 --> 03:35.950
Episode 1

03:32.940 --> 03:35.950
<b>The Girl I Like Forgot Her Glasses</b>

03:41.650 --> 03:43.660
Early modern period, Azuchi-Momoyama
Period to Edo Period

04:04.410 --> 04:06.210
<i>Mie-san sits next to me.</i>

04:06.780 --> 04:08.250
<i>We just had a seating change three days ago.</i>

04:08.250 --> 04:10.040
<i>That's how long we've known each other.</i>

04:11.050 --> 04:13.100
<i>She's always spaced out.</i>

04:13.100 --> 04:15.270
<i>Every time she opens her mouth, 
she says something out of whack.</i>

04:15.900 --> 04:20.030
Wouldn't it be cuter if we started calling 
mechanical pencils "pupens" instead?

04:20.780 --> 04:24.660
<i>But it's this weird girl, Mie-san...</i>

04:27.090 --> 04:29.160
<i>that I've fallen in love with.</i>

04:33.640 --> 04:35.940
<i>Even if it has to be through 
those thick lenses...</i>

04:37.040 --> 04:39.170
<i>I want her to look at me</i>

04:42.560 --> 04:44.200
<i>with her beautiful eyes.</i>

04:52.670 --> 04:54.570
<i>Why isn't she wearing her glasses?</i>

04:55.190 --> 04:56.480
<i>Wait, actually...</i>

04:56.480 --> 04:57.770
<i>this isn't bad, either.</i>

04:58.200 --> 04:59.770
<i>She's cute!</i>

05:05.660 --> 05:08.160
<i>That's Mie-san, right?</i>

05:09.300 --> 05:11.540
<i>She looks so grouchy.</i>

05:12.580 --> 05:14.590
<i>Still so cute, though.</i>

05:16.180 --> 05:17.170
Morning.

05:18.520 --> 05:19.540
M-Morning.

05:20.460 --> 05:23.170
<i>I want to ask why she 
doesn't have her glasses,</i>

05:23.170 --> 05:26.110
<i>but I haven't talked to her properly yet...</i>

05:26.110 --> 05:29.550
<i>I'm so nervous, I don't think I 
could hold a conversation with her.</i>

05:29.550 --> 05:30.300
Um...

05:30.780 --> 05:31.540
Huh?

05:31.540 --> 05:32.810
Err, yes?

05:33.060 --> 05:36.690
I know I probably look 
angry, but don't mind me.

05:36.690 --> 05:39.810
I'm just squinting because I can't see.

05:40.140 --> 05:40.860
Eh?

05:41.260 --> 05:46.360
I forgot my glasses today.

05:47.610 --> 05:49.370
<i>I'm finally talking to her!</i>

05:49.890 --> 05:52.000
Y-You forgot?

05:52.000 --> 05:53.300
Y-Yeah.

05:53.300 --> 05:55.410
So I can't really see.

05:55.410 --> 05:59.250
<i>She came to school without her glasses 
when she couldn't really see?</i>

05:59.250 --> 06:02.800
<i>Wouldn't you notice before you leave home?</i>

06:03.570 --> 06:06.800
<i>I guess that can happen sometimes.</i>

06:06.800 --> 06:10.800
I hadn't forgotten them 
once so far this month...

06:11.200 --> 06:13.300
<i>So it happens often?</i>

06:14.250 --> 06:19.270
<i>A-Anyway, Mie-san is in trouble.</i>

06:19.270 --> 06:20.900
<i>I wish I could help, but...</i>

06:21.280 --> 06:23.020
<i>But I don't know if that's up to me...</i>

06:23.700 --> 06:26.740
<i>No, now's not the time to be thinking that.</i>

06:26.740 --> 06:29.410
<i>I'm gonna support Mie-san today.</i>

06:29.840 --> 06:31.950
<i>As her neighbor!</i>

06:34.220 --> 06:35.000
Hey...

06:35.530 --> 06:36.910
Err...

06:37.170 --> 06:41.180
Which one of these is the history 
textbook for first term?

06:41.180 --> 06:42.820
I can't tell them apart.

06:42.820 --> 06:44.650
Oh, I see.

06:44.650 --> 06:46.490
So the history book...

06:46.490 --> 06:47.800
I'll help you find it.

06:48.930 --> 06:50.430
Can I see your bag?

06:54.720 --> 06:55.680
S...

06:57.370 --> 06:58.840
So close!

06:59.550 --> 07:00.890
W-Wanna use mine?

07:00.890 --> 07:05.150
<b>Japanese History</b>

07:02.270 --> 07:03.630
My textbook.

07:03.630 --> 07:05.150
<i>Y-Y-Yikes!</i>

07:05.150 --> 07:07.070
<i>I have to maintain a proper distance.</i>

07:07.070 --> 07:08.670
Here we go.

07:08.670 --> 07:09.790
Thanks.

07:21.000 --> 07:22.090
What's wrong?

07:22.090 --> 07:23.390
Let's read it together.

07:23.390 --> 07:25.340
No, I'm good.

07:25.340 --> 07:27.220
You can go ahead and use it yourself.

07:27.220 --> 07:28.170
Why?

07:33.680 --> 07:34.720
Why?

07:37.720 --> 07:39.620
On hot summer days,

07:39.620 --> 07:43.200
one would see people spraying water onto 
the street to cool off pedestrians.

07:43.200 --> 07:44.330
<i>So close...</i>

07:44.410 --> 07:45.680
<i>So close...</i>

07:45.680 --> 07:47.230
<i>Get a grip, me!</i>

07:47.230 --> 07:49.760
<i>I'm supporting Mie-san, aren't I?</i>

07:49.760 --> 07:52.950
<i>What am I doing, getting so nervous 
just because she's this close?</i>

07:53.510 --> 07:54.740
Wh-Wh-What's wrong?

07:55.120 --> 07:57.420
I can't see too well.

07:57.420 --> 08:01.250
Wait, I guess you're gonna have a 
hard time seeing the textbook now.

08:01.250 --> 08:03.420
D-Don't mind me.

08:03.420 --> 08:05.360
Don't mind me!

08:05.360 --> 08:06.500
Are you all right?

08:06.890 --> 08:07.620
Yeah.

08:07.620 --> 08:09.740
Really, I'm all right.

08:09.740 --> 08:11.510
You can go ahead and use it yourself.

08:12.650 --> 08:16.020
I don't really use the textbook anyway.

08:16.020 --> 08:17.140
You don't?

08:17.520 --> 08:19.730
Okay, then.

08:19.730 --> 08:20.520
Sorry.

08:20.520 --> 08:22.180
No, it's fine. Honestly.

08:22.480 --> 08:23.790
<i>Too close!</i>

08:23.790 --> 08:26.940
<i>Maybe she's lost her sense of 
distance without her glasses.</i>

08:26.940 --> 08:30.940
<i>O-Or maybe she doesn't really 
care about that kind of thing.</i>

08:30.940 --> 08:33.450
<i>Either way, it's bad for my heart.</i>

08:34.110 --> 08:35.220
<i>Too close!</i>

08:39.200 --> 08:42.780
<i>I'm going to make this 
textbook my family treasure.</i>

08:44.140 --> 08:49.210
<i>It kinda scared me how close we've 
gotten so quickly, literally.</i>

08:50.350 --> 08:54.460
<i>But I feel like I've gotten a little 
closer to her figuratively, too.</i>

08:55.720 --> 08:59.890
<i>Forgetting her glasses isn't 
really anything special to her.</i>

09:00.510 --> 09:04.460
<i>She might not remember much about me, either.</i>

09:05.480 --> 09:09.530
<i>But as long as we can get closer 
little by little, I'm happy.</i>

09:19.410 --> 09:21.430
By the way, who are you?

09:21.430 --> 09:23.500
I can't quite see.

09:24.850 --> 09:27.540
K...Komura.

09:28.560 --> 09:29.340
Oh.

09:29.340 --> 09:30.640
Komura-kun?

09:31.790 --> 09:34.030
He sits next to me.

09:34.030 --> 09:35.060
Right.

09:37.250 --> 09:41.180
Okay, well, thanks again, Komura-kun.

09:57.950 --> 09:59.890
I guess we should go home 
to get changed first.

09:59.220 --> 09:59.890
Yeah.

09:59.890 --> 10:01.990
And then gather at the station?

10:02.640 --> 10:04.200
It's a solid center.

10:04.200 --> 10:05.500
Right?

10:05.500 --> 10:08.370
<i>I never could have expected that.</i>

10:10.770 --> 10:14.380
<i>Thanks to that, I didn't hear
a word the teacher said.</i>

10:19.820 --> 10:21.120
<i>Mie-san's eyes...</i>

10:21.790 --> 10:23.190
<i>Were so pretty.</i>

10:24.210 --> 10:26.640
<i>No, I should forget about that for now.</i>

10:27.150 --> 10:29.760
<i>Or I'm never going to get 
over this lightheadedness...</i>

10:36.770 --> 10:38.050
<i>It's Mie-san.</i>

10:40.140 --> 10:41.460
<i>I wonder what's wrong.</i>

10:43.530 --> 10:44.320
Mie-san.

10:47.200 --> 10:48.330
Is something wrong?

10:48.870 --> 10:49.620
Who are you?

10:49.620 --> 10:50.830
K-Komura.

10:52.530 --> 10:53.630
Komu...

10:53.630 --> 10:54.170
Oh, no...

10:54.710 --> 10:56.680
You know, the one sitting next to you?

10:56.680 --> 10:59.020
The one you got your face <i>really</i> close to.

11:01.050 --> 11:02.680
<b>Embarrassed just 
thinking about it</b>

11:03.030 --> 11:04.540
Oh, Komura-kun?

11:04.540 --> 11:07.060
Thank goodness, you recognized me.

11:07.440 --> 11:09.140
So, what's wrong?

11:09.140 --> 11:10.180
Is everything all right?

11:11.590 --> 11:14.370
Yeah, actually, my shoes...

11:17.080 --> 11:18.530
They're so big.

11:19.860 --> 11:22.220
<i>I never knew she wears the same ones I do.</i>

11:26.220 --> 11:28.720
A-Are you sure those aren't my shoes?

11:28.720 --> 11:29.710
Wha?

11:29.710 --> 11:31.210
<b>A few minutes ago...</b>

11:31.840 --> 11:35.110
Mie-chan, are you sure you don't 
want us to help you get home?

11:35.110 --> 11:37.960
Are you sure you'll know 
which shoe cubby is yours?

11:38.260 --> 11:39.680
I'll be fine.

11:39.680 --> 11:41.780
Just go to your club meets.

11:41.780 --> 11:42.930
Err...

11:44.030 --> 11:46.060
I use that shoe cubby all the time.

11:46.060 --> 11:47.910
I know which one it is.

11:49.190 --> 11:50.390
Wait...

11:50.620 --> 11:52.640
These aren't my shoes.

11:52.640 --> 11:54.520
Huh? Did I get the wrong one?

11:56.600 --> 11:57.900
Which one is it, then?

11:59.200 --> 11:59.990
Huh?

12:03.790 --> 12:04.530
Hm?

12:04.950 --> 12:07.880
So then I tried a bunch 
of cubbies around mine,

12:07.880 --> 12:12.110
and I found a pair that were the same 
as mine, so I thought they were...

12:12.110 --> 12:15.300
<i>S-So sloppy!</i>

12:15.790 --> 12:17.080
Sorry.

12:17.930 --> 12:19.550
No, it's okay.

12:19.790 --> 12:23.360
<i>M-Mie-san is wearing my sho—</i>

12:23.360 --> 12:24.090
<i>No!</i>

12:24.590 --> 12:26.720
<i>Stop thinking like that, me!</i>

12:26.720 --> 12:30.310
<i>Dammit, I'm so jealous of my shoes.</i>

12:30.310 --> 12:32.600
<i>Wait, I mean, they're 
my shoes, so yay, but...</i>

12:33.500 --> 12:34.980
I'll give them back.

12:35.900 --> 12:38.190
Hang on, what about your shoes, then?

12:38.190 --> 12:42.060
I'm pretty sure that's my cubby,

12:42.720 --> 12:45.460
but there's a different pair in there.

12:46.280 --> 12:47.240
I wonder why.

12:51.750 --> 12:56.750
My shoes don't have any green colors on them.

12:59.110 --> 13:01.510
Hey, Mie-san, are you okay 
with frogs and stuff?

13:02.060 --> 13:03.120
Frogs?

13:03.120 --> 13:04.880
I'm okay with them.

13:04.880 --> 13:07.760
It sucks when you get the 
slimy stuff on you, though.

13:07.760 --> 13:08.470
Yeah.

13:08.470 --> 13:09.140
Ribbit.

13:09.140 --> 13:12.630
Would you mind looking away, just in case?

13:12.630 --> 13:13.320
Hm?

13:14.100 --> 13:14.920
Okay.

13:22.410 --> 13:23.400
Ribbit.

13:23.560 --> 13:24.300
Ribbit.

13:25.000 --> 13:25.730
Ribbit.

13:25.730 --> 13:28.410
Hey, are these your shoes?

13:28.410 --> 13:29.610
I think I found them.

13:31.200 --> 13:32.810
Thank goodness.

13:34.000 --> 13:35.470
Was there a frog on them?

13:37.500 --> 13:38.220
Yeah.

13:43.030 --> 13:46.340
I wiped it off good, but 
it's still kinda horrible.

13:46.340 --> 13:47.150
Yeah.

13:47.150 --> 13:49.090
I feel for you.

14:01.600 --> 14:03.230
Well, let's go.

14:08.600 --> 14:09.790
Wait, Mie-san.

14:11.730 --> 14:13.220
Your shoelaces are undone.

14:22.270 --> 14:23.920
There.

14:27.160 --> 14:29.580
I thank you kindly for all your services.

14:29.580 --> 14:31.920
I shall return the favor someday.

14:31.920 --> 14:32.390
It's fine.

14:32.390 --> 14:34.740
<i>She's talking like a samurai all of a sudden.</i>

14:36.640 --> 14:38.550
<i>Just her feet!</i>

14:38.550 --> 14:40.650
<i>Keep your eyes on just her feet, me!</i>

14:41.010 --> 14:44.900
Komura-kun, thanks for 
everything today. Really.

14:46.880 --> 14:51.660
You helped me out a lot today.

14:52.910 --> 14:54.660
<i>Right.</i>

14:55.360 --> 14:58.620
<i>I've been with Mie-san all day today.</i>

14:59.760 --> 15:01.580
<i>I hope I don't forget this.</i>

15:12.400 --> 15:16.360
<i>I hope I don't forget anything 
that happened today.</i>

15:19.140 --> 15:24.250
<i>Her pretty eyes, which I saw point blank.</i>

15:34.200 --> 15:36.200
Wh-What?

15:36.200 --> 15:39.410
I mean, I feel like I need to thank you.

15:40.380 --> 15:44.310
So I want to make sure 
I don't forget your face.

15:53.860 --> 15:56.140
Nope, I can't quite see.

16:00.740 --> 16:03.350
Show me properly next time.

16:04.120 --> 16:04.570
Huh?

16:04.570 --> 16:05.190
Bye.

16:20.660 --> 16:24.940
<i>Turns out Mie-san lives 
super close to school.</i>

16:20.660 --> 16:26.170
School

16:22.210 --> 16:26.170
Mie, Mie, Mie...

16:26.420 --> 16:30.550
<i>No wonder she survived up until now.</i>

16:32.660 --> 16:35.930
<i>I shouldn't be thinking this, but...</i>

16:37.650 --> 16:41.930
<i>I hope Mie-san forgets her glasses again.</i>

16:46.000 --> 16:47.260
Morning.

16:52.340 --> 16:53.710
Are you all right?

16:55.630 --> 16:57.460
<i>She forgot again?!</i>

16:57.460 --> 16:59.580
<i>I know I wished upon the stars, but...</i>

16:59.830 --> 17:00.820
<i>Or...</i>

17:00.820 --> 17:02.830
<i>Maybe I jinxed it.</i>

17:02.830 --> 17:04.480
<i>I'm sorry, Mie-san!</i>

17:04.480 --> 17:06.620
<i>I might have jinxed it.</i>

17:07.100 --> 17:09.630
I stepped on my glasses and broke them.

17:10.960 --> 17:13.210
<i>That definitely sounds like a curse!</i>

17:17.540 --> 17:18.230
Okay.

17:19.250 --> 17:21.140
Why would you play in court?!

17:21.140 --> 17:23.220
Why are you even playing at all?!

17:23.570 --> 17:25.980
I don't want to miss class over this!

17:26.300 --> 17:27.940
It's a life-or-death problem!

17:27.940 --> 17:29.280
I mean, see?

17:29.280 --> 17:31.370
You can't even see the ball, can you?

17:31.370 --> 17:33.740
I can't tell who's friend or foe, either.

17:32.990 --> 17:33.740
Mie-chan...

17:33.740 --> 17:34.390
See?

17:34.390 --> 17:36.530
Now you're talking like we're in a war!

17:37.740 --> 17:41.140
<i>This was all because I cursed her.</i>

17:41.140 --> 17:44.700
<i>I hope Mie-san forgets her glasses again.</i>

17:44.700 --> 17:49.040
<i>I shall stop every ball headed 
in Mie-san's direction!</i>

17:49.040 --> 17:49.980
I know.

17:50.710 --> 17:52.710
Can I hide behind you, Komura-kun?

17:55.340 --> 17:56.150
Boop.

17:56.150 --> 17:57.930
Komura, you're out.

18:02.580 --> 18:08.560
Mechanical energy can be 
either kinetic or potential.

18:09.240 --> 18:12.350
When an outside force is applied to a mass,

18:10.320 --> 18:12.350
<i>I'm so sleepy...</i>

18:12.350 --> 18:15.650
<i>That gym class wore me out 
in more ways than one.</i>

18:12.350 --> 18:16.710
there is a conservative force that 
determines its potential energy.

18:16.710 --> 18:20.410
When there is no external force 
besides the potential force itself,

18:20.410 --> 18:24.020
the sum of the kinetic force and 
potential force is constant.

18:21.090 --> 18:24.020
<i>Mie-san's focused so hard on her textbook.</i>

18:24.020 --> 18:25.160
<i>All right.</i>

18:24.020 --> 18:27.960
In physics, we call this the 
law of conservation of energy.

18:25.530 --> 18:27.960
<i>I need to follow her lead, too.</i>

18:28.480 --> 18:29.710
Get up, Mie!

18:30.370 --> 18:31.590
<i>Right!</i>

18:31.590 --> 18:34.170
<i>She looks like she's 
sleeping in that position.</i>

18:34.170 --> 18:36.460
Mie-san, he's talking to you.

18:39.680 --> 18:40.590
<i>She's asleep!</i>

18:42.290 --> 18:44.070
<i>She's totally asleep!</i>

18:45.100 --> 18:46.440
<i>Why is she sleeping now?</i>

18:46.440 --> 18:47.730
The enemy...

18:49.040 --> 18:52.440
Hide, Komura-kun.

18:52.980 --> 18:55.400
<i>Dodgeball must have been miserable 
without her glasses...</i>

18:55.400 --> 18:58.390
<i>And yet, she was completely focused!</i>

18:58.390 --> 18:59.940
I'll handle this, Komura-kun!

19:01.950 --> 19:03.600
<i>Friend, foe...</i>

19:03.600 --> 19:06.040
<i>She couldn't tell who was friend or foe...</i>

19:06.040 --> 19:09.310
<i>She must have been more exhausted than usual.</i>

19:09.310 --> 19:10.490
<i>Dammit!</i>

19:10.490 --> 19:14.340
<i>There's part of me that's thoroughly 
enjoying how much she's done for me!</i>

19:14.340 --> 19:16.210
Are you listening, Mie?!

19:16.460 --> 19:18.850
<i>I need to wake her up.</i>

19:20.180 --> 19:21.220
Mie-sa—

19:21.950 --> 19:22.890
<i>No, I can't!</i>

19:23.200 --> 19:26.220
<i>Waking her up would mean touching her!</i>

19:26.220 --> 19:27.090
<i>Nope!</i>

19:27.090 --> 19:28.210
<i>I can't!</i>

19:29.140 --> 19:29.980
Mie!

19:30.980 --> 19:32.400
Get up, Mie!

19:32.840 --> 19:33.650
U-Um...

19:36.190 --> 19:37.870
S-Sensei...

19:37.870 --> 19:40.400
Mie-san forgot her glasses today.

19:40.400 --> 19:43.410
She can't seem to see her 
textbook unless she gets close.

19:43.910 --> 19:45.720
She's not asleep.

19:48.320 --> 19:51.100
You could have said so, then.

19:55.420 --> 19:57.750
And so thusly...

19:58.240 --> 20:02.760
<i>I managed to fool him for now, but 
I can't let her keep sleeping.</i>

20:03.290 --> 20:05.480
<i>I have to wake her up somehow.</i>

20:07.120 --> 20:08.160
<i>Nope! I can't!</i>

20:08.160 --> 20:10.180
<i>I can't bring myself to touch her!</i>

20:15.180 --> 20:16.140
<i>She's up.</i>

20:22.300 --> 20:23.970
<i>What is she doing?</i>

20:30.850 --> 20:32.120
Dad?

20:33.870 --> 20:35.920
Have you seen my glasses?

20:45.290 --> 20:47.170
M-Mie-san, are you still asleep?

20:47.170 --> 20:49.000
I'm not your dad...

20:51.650 --> 20:53.120
You <i>are</i> Dad.

20:54.690 --> 20:58.690
<i>It's a can't-see, can't-wake-up combo attack!</i>

20:59.030 --> 21:03.520
You're probably wearing 
mine again by accident.

21:03.520 --> 21:06.160
You never pay attention, do you?

21:07.680 --> 21:10.280
<i>I feel like I'm watching 
something I shouldn't.</i>

21:10.280 --> 21:11.440
Whatever.

21:11.440 --> 21:13.410
I'm gonna get a little more sleep.

21:13.850 --> 21:16.290
No, Mie-san! You have to get up!

21:23.280 --> 21:24.460
Hmm...

21:25.020 --> 21:27.330
Dad, have you shrunk?

21:29.090 --> 21:33.060
<i>I ended up touching Mie-san.</i>

21:33.060 --> 21:34.450
<i>In fact...</i>

21:36.060 --> 21:41.570
<i>Please, God, let this moment last forever.</i>

21:41.730 --> 21:42.740
<b>Thwap</b>

21:44.400 --> 21:46.940
<i>Sensei-sama would not allow it.</i>

21:59.500 --> 22:01.790
<i>She's forgotten her glasses again.</i>

22:01.790 --> 22:06.550
<i>I mean, I've gotten used to it by now, 
but I worry for her if she keeps this up.</i>

22:07.500 --> 22:09.510
<i>Is there anything we can do?</i>

22:09.510 --> 22:10.120
Err...

22:16.800 --> 22:18.820
It's me. Komura.

22:18.820 --> 22:20.060
So, uh...

22:20.440 --> 22:24.070
Wh-Wh-Wh-What is this?

22:27.030 --> 22:30.620
<i>I'm definitely blushing right now.</i>

22:31.050 --> 22:33.530
<i>Thank goodness she can't see.</i>

22:34.270 --> 22:35.290
I see.

22:37.600 --> 22:39.790
So that's what you look like.

22:46.130 --> 22:48.080
Oh, morning, Mie-chan.

22:48.080 --> 22:49.530
Are you bare-eyed again?!

22:49.530 --> 22:50.430
No.

22:50.430 --> 22:52.480
I'm trying out contacts today.

22:52.480 --> 22:53.640
I can see properly.

22:53.990 --> 22:56.800
So why do you still look so cranky, then?

22:56.800 --> 22:59.930
I can't get used to the 
lumpy feeling in my eyes.

23:10.720 --> 23:11.910
Komura Kaede here.

23:11.910 --> 23:13.280
I'm about to do an episode preview.

23:13.920 --> 23:17.040
Should I really be the one doing this?

23:17.680 --> 23:18.830
Let's see...

23:18.830 --> 23:24.090
"One weekend day, Mie-san invites Komura-kun 
to come out to the city with her..."

23:24.690 --> 23:26.750
Mie-san's going to ask me out?!

23:27.170 --> 23:28.340
Wh-Why?!

23:28.340 --> 23:30.000
How is that happening?!

23:30.000 --> 23:32.160
The two of us are going 
 to town on a weekend?

23:32.160 --> 23:33.890
Isn't that...

23:33.890 --> 23:36.400
Next episode: "The Girl I Like Asked Me Out"

23:33.890 --> 23:39.930
Episode 2

23:33.890 --> 23:39.930
The Girl I Like Asked Me Out

23:36.400 --> 23:37.930
See you then!
